# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Plugin binary built by `go build`
/silo-plugin-gotify

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file (both spellings: Git on Linux and macOS is case-sensitive)
.env
.ENV

# Build plan and research handoff (local only)
/BUILD_PLAN.md
/.handoff/

# Claude Code local settings
/.claude/

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

# Release build output and test notes (local only)
/dist/
/TESTING.md
/FEATURE_REQUEST.md
